The products are okay, but the after-sales service of Amazon is really much worse than other websites.
After placing the order, I found that I had made a mistake, but I couldn't cancel the order. The error page of the online customer service showed an error link, and I couldn't contact it.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When I applied for return, I was told that food items cannot be returned once they are signed for. I could not call Amazon customer service, and they said the same thing.
I have bought products that cannot be returned according to the policy in JD and Sunning, including milk and diapers, and I have contacted customer service to return them, and JD's diapers smell too much when opened, but I still contacted customer service to return them, but it doesn't work with Amazon.
The rules are dead, people are alive, how should we handle this? Contact our customer service department.
Tell me either I pick it up myself or let the delivery person buy it for me. It's not easy for the delivery person already. Why should I let the delivery person buy the thing I didn't buy myself?
Okay, I won't back out either. I'll take it myself, but I have to give your service a 1
The earphone has a distortion and there is a background noise
This headphone is really trash, I don't know if it's my ears that are the problem or if this headphone really isn't as good as it used to be.
I bought a blue one two years ago on a certain Taobao, the sound quality is not bad, there is no noise and the bass is good, I used it for more than two years and it broke down, so I want to buy another one (urbeats). After all, I feel it is not bad.
I bought a purple one, which is quite good looking, but when I opened it today, I found that the sound was not right. The sound was either too loud or too soft.
I thought it was just the sound effects of that song and didn't give much thought to it at first, but after listening for hours I realized this problem was quite serious. Not only were there off-key notes, but also poor bass quality compared to what I had heard before. There were some additional noises, is it possible that only my purple headphones have this issue? Or could it be that the headphone manufacturing process has indeed fallen short?
Very poor review, very disappointing.
I definitely have to return the goods tomorrow.
Looks good.
Amazon should not sell this kind of product
Buy it when it is on sale, the price is not low, and the comments are also very good.
I was shocked when I received the product. The surface of the product was heavily damaged, and there were many other places with damages. It was either a fake or a used product. Here is the picture.
I applied for a return, and the factory said that it was the transportation that caused it, is this not nonsense?
How could the goods be worn out inside?
There are only two possibilities: either it is a defective or a used product, or I deliberately damaged the product and then returned it.
Objectively, I have no evidence to prove that I didn't damage the goods, but based on my shopping record on Amazon, I think such goods shouldn't appear in Amazon's self-sold goods. Customers choose Amazon's self-sold goods with trust, customer win, we win, customers' victory is the victory of manufacturers, and I hope everyone can work together to improve, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate and within acceptable error limits; it comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate inside the box, and the 12-word mark on the dial is genuine diamond. It fits well for personal use, and as a gift, it adds to one's prestige.
